      10 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استمحض</span></b>  [<i>He asked for,</i> or <i>demanded,</i> or
<i>desired, milk such as is termed</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَحْض</span>]. (A.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
[In a copy of the A, it has also assigned to it
the signification given above to <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَحِضَ</span> and
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">امتحض</span>; but in this instance I think it a
mistranscription for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">امتحض</span>.]

